const aliases={mania:['間に合う','電車','列車','駅','発車','出発','時刻表','交通','乗車','使いやすさ','UI','UX'],career:['就活','就職','応募','締切','予定','カレンダー','ES','面接','募集'],stream:['配信','レイアウト','OBS','YouTube','VTube Studio'],voice:['音声','音声読み上げ','読み上げ','会話','Discord','翻訳','VOICEVOX','voice'],weather:['地震','災害','防災','津波','気象','通知','Discord'],moral:['AI','倫理','個人研究','行動判断','影響評価','安全','予測'],proxy:['通信','セキュリティ','検査','プロキシ','ログ','HTTP','HTTPS'],soccer:['ロボット','サッカー','SSL','Ri-one','立命館','戦略','位置評価','AI','Java']};
const normalize=value=>String(value??'').normalize('NFKC').toLocaleLowerCase('ja-JP').replace(/[\s、,]+/g,' ').trim();
function contains(text,token){if(/^[a-z0-9+#.-]+$/.test(token)){for(let at=text.indexOf(token);at!==-1;at=text.indexOf(token,at+1)){const before=at?text[at-1]:'',after=text[at+token.length]||'';if(!/[a-z0-9]/.test(before)&&!/[a-z0-9]/.test(after))return true}return false}return text.includes(token)}
export function projectRecords(projects){return projects.map(p=>({...p,id:p.kind,type:'作品',keywords:aliases[p.kind]||[],body:[p.status?.label,p.status?.detail,p.summary,p.purpose,p.trigger,p.engineering,p.impact,p.limits,p.outlook,p.history?.reason,p.history?.result,p.reflectionTitle,p.reflection,...(p.flow||[]),...p.tags,...(p.features||[]),p.caseStudy.decision.choice,p.caseStudy.decision.reason,p.caseStudy.role.scope,p.caseStudy.role.collaboration,p.caseStudy.ai?.human,p.caseStudy.ai?.assistant,...p.caseStudy.process.flatMap(s=>[s.title,s.body])].filter(Boolean).join(' ')}))}
export const sectionBooks=[{id:'section-about',type:'自己紹介',short:'自己紹介',title:'自己紹介',selector:'.home-intro',path:'/#home-title',keywords:['自己紹介','プロフィール','北岡英磨','AMZ']},{id:'section-philosophy',type:'理念',short:'理念',title:'個人開発と個人研究の理念',selector:'#philosophy',path:'/#philosophy',keywords:['理念','考え方','大切にすること','ヒアリング','レビュー','個人研究']},{id:'section-activity',type:'活動',short:'Ri-one',title:'Ri-oneでの活動',selector:'.activity-card',path:'/#activity-title',keywords:['活動','Ri-one','立命館','ロボット','戦略班','ゴールキーパー','Java']},{id:'section-history',type:'年表',short:'作成記録',title:'リポジトリの作成記録',selector:'.notebook',path:'/#repository-history-title',keywords:['年表','作成年月','リポジトリ','作成記録','開発の歩み']},{id:'section-diary',type:'開発記録',short:'更新',title:'最近の開発記録',selector:'.github-diary',path:'/#diary-title',keywords:['最新','最近','更新','開発記録','GitHub','日記','push']},{id:'section-closing',type:'メッセージ',short:'メッセージ',title:'一緒につくりたいこと',selector:'#closing',path:'/#closing',keywords:['抱負','夢','ドラえもん','のび太','採用','PdM','プロダクトマネージャー','一緒に働く']}];
export function siteRecords(base,root){return[...base,...sectionBooks.map((s,i)=>{const el=root.querySelector(s.selector);let body=el?[...el.querySelectorAll('h1,h2,h3,h4,p,time,strong')].filter(e=>!e.closest('[aria-hidden=true]')).map(e=>e.textContent).join(' '):'';if(s.type==='年表')body=[root.querySelector('.timeline-note')?.textContent,...[...root.querySelectorAll('.notebook-tab time')].map(e=>e.textContent)].join(' ');const excerpts=s.type==='年表'?[root.querySelector('.timeline-note')?.textContent]:el?[...el.querySelectorAll('p:not(.eyebrow):not(.diary-note)')].filter(e=>!e.closest('[aria-hidden=true]')).map(e=>e.textContent):[];return{...s,number:'S'+(i+1),body:body.replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim(),excerpts:excerpts.filter(Boolean),tags:[],path:s.path}})]}
export function searchRecords(records,query){const tokens=normalize(query).split(' ').filter(Boolean);return records.map((record,index)=>{const title=normalize(record.title),keywords=normalize((record.keywords||[]).join(' ')),body=normalize(record.body),text=title+' '+keywords+' '+body;const matches=tokens.every(t=>contains(text,t));const score=tokens.reduce((n,t)=>n+(title===t?100:contains(title,t)?60:contains(keywords,t)?40:10),0);return{record,index,matches,score}}).filter(x=>x.matches).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score||a.index-b.index).map(x=>x.record)}
export function snippet(record,query){
 const tokens=normalize(query).split(' ').filter(Boolean),paragraphs=record.excerpts?.length?record.excerpts:[record.summary||record.body];
 const text=(paragraphs.find(p=>tokens.some(t=>contains(normalize(p),t)))||paragraphs[0]).replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();
 // Keep a complete sentence rather than cutting through Japanese words around a match.
 const sentences=text.match(/[^。]+。?/g)||[text];
 const chosen=sentences.find(s=>tokens.some(t=>contains(normalize(s),t)))||sentences[0]||'';
 return chosen.length>150?chosen.slice(0,150)+'…':chosen;
}
export function searchProjects(projects,query){return searchRecords(projectRecords(projects),query)}
